            <p class="mb-0">The long term goal is to develop a community based around principles of Yomonsni. Extending the thoughts of personal <a href="../development/index.html">development</a> to form a framework for a community based around inclusion and development of individuals within a tightly woven social fabric that ensures no one is ever left to fend for themselves. </p>
